+| 0.1.1 | x86_64 | `https://github.com/huangy7/lokii/releases/download/v0.1.1/Lokii-x86_64.dmg` | 5097455 | `c4ac59725bbaf9779ad40490b2b5290a621bbc0827ee7cfce071b8d062342593` |
+| 0.1.0 | arm64 | `https://github.com/huangy7/lokii/releases/download/v0.1.0/Lokii-arm64.dmg` | 1974275 | `2d548bf68bc5e1e6fe9c143b6c42f22c3ff2dd744779c51c19c0d36e44ef2924` |
+| 0.1.0 | x86_64 | `https://github.com/huangy7/lokii/releases/download/v0.1.0/Lokii-x86_64.dmg` | 2081789 | `483685fddd0712c62128c1409895f3d09bb937578d0ba2ec6c9aaf3f1418856a` |
+
